### Upload API - requests de prueba interactivas
### Abrir con HTTP Client (IntelliJ IDEA) o REST Client (VS Code).
### La API debe correr en el perfil local antes de ejecutar.
### Ejecutar los bloques EN ORDEN: 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 (complete).
### Los IDs y URLs se capturan automáticamente entre bloques.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@idempotencyKey = demo-flujo-001

### 1) Crear sesión (25 MiB -> 3 partes de 10 MiB)
# @name createUpload
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "clip.mp4",
  "contentType": "video/mp4",
  "size": 26214400
}

> {% client.global.set("uploadId", response.body.uploadId); %}

### 1b) Idempotencia: repetir la MISMA petición debe dar 200 con el MISMO uploadId
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "clip.mp4",
  "contentType": "video/mp4",
  "size": 26214400
}

### 2) Pedir presigned URLs de todas las partes (TTL 15 min)
# @name presignParts
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}/parts
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partNumbers": [1, 2, 3]
}

> {%
  for (const p of response.body.parts) {
    client.global.set("uploadUrl" + p.partNumber, p.uploadUrl);
  }
%}

### 3) Subir cada parte DIRECTAMENTE a MinIO con su URL presignada (no pasa por la API)
### Cada PUT devuelve un header ETag que hay que registrar en el paso 4.
# @name uploadPart1
PUT {{uploadUrl1}}

< @testdata/part1.bin

> {% client.global.set("etag1", response.headers["ETag"]); %}

# @name uploadPart2
PUT {{uploadUrl2}}

< @testdata/part2.bin

> {% client.global.set("etag2", response.headers["ETag"]); %}

# @name uploadPart3
PUT {{uploadUrl3}}

< @testdata/part3.bin

> {% client.global.set("etag3", response.headers["ETag"]); %}

### 4) Ack de cada parte
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}/parts/1/ack
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "etag": "{{etag1}}",
  "size": 10485760
}

### 5) Completar el upload (una entrada por parte, con su ETag)
# @name completeUpload
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}/complete
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parts": [
    {"partNumber": 1, "etag": "{{etag1}}"},
    {"partNumber": 2, "etag": "{{etag2}}"},
    {"partNumber": 3, "etag": "{{etag3}}"}
  ]
}

### 6) Estado / partes subidas
GET {{base}}/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 7) Cancelar (aborta el multipart en MinIO)
DELETE {{base}}/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 8) Error: contentType no permitido (400 INVALID_FILE_TYPE)
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "nota.txt",
  "contentType": "text/plain",
  "size": 100
}

### 9) Error: otro usuario no puede acceder (403 UNAUTHORIZED_UPLOAD)
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}/parts
X-User-Id: 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partNumbers": [1]
}